Z||000000||Jncomutt||12-02-2001||11:22 PM||||Quick question for the techies out there.  My monitor went yellow.  It has this awful yellow tint to it now.  I don't know how it happened, and it just appeared, not gradual.  I noticed if I turn the monitor upside down, however, it will go away.  What the heck is goin on here???||||reg||1
